---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — Conatus Real Estate"
  description="Conatus Real Estate builds AI-powered operations platforms for regulated industries. Deep operational expertise in SFR, powered by Claude."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container--narrow">
      <p class="page-label">About</p>
      <h1>Deep domain expertise.<br /><span class="accent">AI-native</span> execution.</h1>

      <div class="prose">
        <p class="lead">
          Conatus Real Estate Inc. builds AI-powered operations platforms for regulated
          industries. We combine deep operational expertise — honed through 4,000+ SFR
          transactions and $1B+ in acquisitions capital — with AI-native development
          practices powered by Claude.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Approach</h2>
        <p>
          Every engagement starts with understanding the operational reality on the ground.
          Technology should serve operations, not the other way around. Our platforms are
          built by operators who understand the domain from the inside — then enhanced
          with AI that makes those operations faster, more consistent, and scalable.
        </p>

        <h2>What Sets Us Apart</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Operational depth</strong> &mdash; We've built and operated platforms that executed thousands of real estate transactions. We're not just consultants — we're operators.</li>
          <li><strong>AI-native development</strong> &mdash; Every platform we build leverages Claude's intelligence through MCP integrations, autonomous agents, and AI-driven analysis pipelines.</li>
          <li><strong>Regulated industry focus</strong> &mdash; We understand compliance requirements, audit trails, and the operational constraints of regulated industries.</li>
          <li><strong>Production systems</strong> &mdash; Not prototypes or demos — purpose-built platforms running real operations at scale.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Domain Coverage</h2>
        <p>
          Our deepest expertise is in single-family residential real estate — acquisitions,
          SFR asset management, HCV operations, and compliance. We're applying the same
          approach across financial services, private lending, and broader asset management,
          building purpose-built platforms informed by deep domain understanding.
        </p>

        <h2>Leadership</h2>
        <p>
          <a href="/leadership">Meet our founder &rarr;</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }
</style>
